/target

# napi-rs build outputs — generated fresh per platform by `npm run build`
# (locally) or the release workflow (per-target in CI). Never hand-edited,
# never meant to be committed; see index.js for why the dispatch loader is
# named native-binding.js instead of the napi-rs default of index.js.
*.node
native-binding.js
native-binding.d.ts
index.node
